\contentsline {paragraph}{Four segments are sufficient.}{38}{section*.29}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{Co-located solar and load increase the value of the battery.}{38}{section*.30}%
\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {7.5.2}Forecast-driven dispatch}{38}{subsection.7.5.2}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{The rolling loop costs nothing under perfect information.}{39}{section*.32}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{Most of the loss comes from the household forecast, not the price forecast.}{40}{section*.33}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{A more accurate price forecast did not produce more dispatch value.}{40}{section*.34}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{AEMO pre-dispatch is the most accurate forecast in normal conditions and the least accurate on average.}{40}{section*.35}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{Forecast accuracy and dispatch value are only loosely related.}{40}{section*.36}%
